Radioify for Windows
====================

This bundle contains a prebuilt Windows x64 copy of Radioify.

Install on this PC:
- Double-click install_radioify.cmd
- Or run install_radioify.ps1 from PowerShell

Portable use:
- Run radioify.exe directly from the extracted folder

What the installer does:
- Installs the full MSIX package that owns Radioify, file associations, and
  Explorer integration

Notes:
- Installing may trigger a UAC prompt to trust the development certificate
- The extracted bundle contains the signed .msix and its certificate at the
  bundle root. Manifest inputs stay under win11-explorer-integration.
- PSF2 playback still needs hebios.bin supplied separately
- Model weights and the optional Python/CUDA speech runtime are downloaded
  when their feature is first requested. They remain in the per-user Radioify
  cache across application updates. Ordinary playback starts no AI downloads.
- Generate transcript uses Qwen3-ASR-1.7B with Whisper large-v3 word timing
  on a supported NVIDIA GPU. Obscured or overlapping speech needs listening review.
- Audio separation uses the BandIt v2 model with the native NVIDIA Windows ML
  provider. Attribution is in models\audio_separation\BandIt-v2-MODEL-CARD.
- AI video review is an explicit video-editor action. It does not create
  automatic playback chapters or alter media without the user's editing actions.
- Native analysis uses an isolated child process of radioify.exe so playback
  can reclaim GPU resources and cancel work. Third-party notices accompany
  the application and optional runtime.
